  "description": "Minimal, unstyled ASP.NET Core diagnostics pages for the site they are mounted in: a request performance page (the slowest calls and per-route percentiles over a configurable window, with a collector memory budget of 2 MiB by default), an application logs page over the host's JSON log files (filters, exclusion rules, CSV export, purge), a file logger writing compact Serilog JSON without depending on Serilog, and a public API to read the logs in the host's own screens.",
